// Bogglemire: Bog Toad, Mudling, Lantern Wisp, Reed Witch, Bogsnapper, Old Mother Murk and her second atlas. The Frostcrown: Snow Goat, Frostling, Crag Goblin, Pebble Golem, Old Bighorn, Frostbeard and his second atlas.
